; Plate carrier. See body_armour.gd: worn rather than held, so like the jump jet
; it has no sights, no trigger and nothing that ever reaches a pair of hands.
;
; A front and back plate in a canvas carrier, with shoulder straps over. Only
; ever seen from outside -- in first person the body it is strapped to is
; shadows-only -- so it is built for a silhouette rather than for close reading.
